---
const target = "/products/vectra";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content={`0; url=${target}`} />
    <title>山止组件 Vectra</title>
    <script is:inline>
      window.location.replace("/products/vectra");
    </script>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        display: grid;
        min-height: 100vh;
        place-items: center;
        background: #11121c;
        color: #d1d5db;
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      }
      a {
        color: #60a5fa;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>
      山止组件已更名为 Vectra，正在跳转……
      <a href={target}>立即前往 Vectra</a>
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
